              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-48387\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: tar-fs\nFixed Version: 1.16.5, 2.1.3, 3.0.9\nLink: [CVE-2025-48387](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-48387)\ntar-fs provides filesystem bindings for tar-stream. Versions prior to 3.0.9, 2.1.3, and 1.16.5 have an issue where an extract can write outside the specified dir with a specific tarball. This has been patched in versions 3.0.9, 2.1.3, and 1.16.5. As a workaround, use the ignore option to ignore non files/directories.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-48387**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|tar-fs|1.16.5, 2.1.3, 3.0.9|[CVE-2025-48387](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-48387)|\n\ntar-fs provides filesystem bindings for tar-stream. Versions prior to 3.0.9, 2.1.3, and 1.16.5 have an issue where an extract can write outside the specified dir with a specific tarball. This has been patched in versions 3.0.9, 2.1.3, and 1.16.5. As a workaround, use the ignore option to ignore non files/directories."
              },
              "properties": {
                "cvssv40_baseScore": 8.7,
                "cvssv40_vector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N",
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
